      "created_at": "2020-03-09T14:39:27Z",
      "updated_at": "2020-03-09T14:39:27Z",
      "body": "How does this issue relate to the current European privacy legislation? I don't think it covers making private content public is allowed in that, at least not with explicit consent. Why isn't this solved yet? I also notice that students tend to upload the same image multiple times, which might, which can mean the dialog isn't clear for them too.",
