      "created_at": "2020-03-12T10:52:58Z",
      "updated_at": "2020-03-12T10:52:58Z",
      "body": "We are not legal experts, so if you need advice on the legislation, we suggest you consult an attorney.\r\n\r\nThat said, having these files publicly accessible is not our intention, so I've changed this to a 'bug' rather than an 'enhancement'.\r\n\r\nOur proposed solution is to obfuscate the file url with a random string, so that they won't be publicly available/guessable/browseable. I can't provide a timeline at this stage, but we do intend to get this fixed.",
      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
